# astrion-skill v1
goal: Close all running apps with confirmation
trigger:
  - phrase: "close everything"
  - phrase: "quit all apps"
  - phrase: "close all"
do: |
  Call processManager.getRunningApps() for all running apps. Show a
  rapid-confirm modal listing the apps + a count: "Quit all N apps?
  Unsaved work will be lost." On confirm, call processManager.terminate
  on each instanceId. Skip apps with unsaved indicators (the app
  exposes a 'hasUnsavedChanges' getter); return their list at the end
  so the user knows what stayed open.
constraints:
  level: L3
  budget_tokens: 400
  reversibility: BOUNDED
